Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.51,0:00:06.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Yu-Gi-Oh! Yu-Gi-Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.79,0:00:08.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Yu-Gi-Oh! Yu
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.29,0:00:14.57,Default,,0,0,0,,-Gi
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.65,0:00:15.89,Default,,0,0,0,,-Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.97,0:00:17.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Gui-Gi-Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.33,0:01:09.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Accepting our challenge was\Na huge mistake. When this
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.71,0:01:12.91,Default,,0,0,0,,double duel is over You two\Nwill be banished to the Shadow
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.99,0:01:16.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Realm Then we'll deliver both\Nof your Egyptian God Cards
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.41,0:01:19.71,Default,,0,0,0,,To Master Merrick, and he\Nshall possess all three.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.99,0:01:24.11,Default,,0,0,0,,We will prevail. And you will release\NSmokova and my friends. Never.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.83,0:01:28.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Just look at this
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.39,0:01:33.55,Default,,0,0,0,,it's my mask of the accursed\Nmagic card and once i
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.63,0:01:36.33,Default,,0,0,0,,place it on your monster\Nit will be rendered useless
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.41,0:01:43.15,Default,,0,0,0,,yugi so try my mask on for\Nsize magnet warrior it's
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.23,0:01:46.17,Default,,0,0,0,,a perfect fit as long as\Nthis mask stays on your
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.25,0:01:49.17,Default,,0,0,0,,monster can't attack or\Ndefend and that's not the
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.25,0:01:52.31,Default,,0,0,0,,only effect yugi until the\Nmask comes off you will
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.39,0:01:55.81,Default,,0,0,0,,lose 500 life points for\Nevery turn you take you're
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.89,0:01:59.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Finished. I'll also also\Nplace one card face down.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.19,0:02:01.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Now it's back to your side.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.17,0:02:03.79,Default,,0,0,0,,It's probably a trap card.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.17,0:02:06.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Loomis hasn't played one monster card yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.17,0:02:09.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I think I'm onto their team strategy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.21,0:02:12.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I bet Umbra holds their\Nmonster arsenal in his deck,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.53,0:02:17.12,Default,,0,0,0,,while Loomis holds a deck full of magic\Nand trap cards to weaken our monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.59,0:02:22.73,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll be in the Shadow Realm very soon,\Nas soon as your life points reach zero.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.11,0:02:28.21,Default,,0,0,0,,And speaking of life points, you lose 500\Nthanks to my Mask of the Accursed. Enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.31,0:02:31.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Perfect!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.22,0:02:32.36,Default,,0,0,0,,The Beast of Guilfer!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.59,0:02:34.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I can sacrifice my Magnet Warrior,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.99,0:02:39.15,Default,,0,0,0,,destroying their Mask of the Accursed,\Nand summon this more powerful monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.23,0:02:42.69,Default,,0,0,0,,If Yugi makes a foolish move,\Nhe'll take me down with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.89,0:02:44.73,Default,,0,0,0,,So he'd better not screw this up.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.81,0:02:49.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I defeated these two rare hunters on\Nmy own before, and I can do it again.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.89,0:02:52.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you make your move, Yugi?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.29,0:02:55.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Trying to delay your\Ntrip to the Shadow Realm?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.95,0:02:56.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Not quite.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.86,0:03:01.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, I'll sacrifice my Magnet Warrior!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.79,0:03:04.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Not so fast, Yugi! Behold!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.95,0:03:07.01,Default,,0,0,0,,You've just triggered my trap card!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.55,0:03:08.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Mask of Restrict!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.29,0:03:13.13,Default,,0,0,0,,With this on the field, you two can't win!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.43,0:03:17.37,Default,,0,0,0,,That's because as long as my Mask\Nof Restrict card remains in play.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.49,0:03:20.02,Default,,0,0,0,,neither of you can\Nsacrifice your monsters!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.15,0:03:21.55,Default,,0,0,0,,And without sacrifices,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.81,0:03:24.41,Default,,0,0,0,,you two can't summon more\Npowerful monsters to the field,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.49,0:03:27.07,Default,,0,0,0,,making it that much easier to defeat you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.65,0:03:28.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.91,0:03:32.03,Default,,0,0,0,,If we lose this duel because\Nof Yugi, he'll be sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.23,0:03:35.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course, without the\Nability to sacrifice,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.27,0:03:39.07,Default,,0,0,0,,your Egyptian god cards\Nare all but useless now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.15,0:03:41.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Until we claim them for Marek.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.47,0:03:42.83,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll see about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.01,0:03:45.35,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way we can\Nwin with weak monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.43,0:03:47.49,Default,,0,0,0,,We've got to turn this duel around.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.65,0:03:52.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll place one card face down, and then\NI will summon Karibo in defense mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.49,0:03:58.67,Default,,0,0,0,,If we're gonna beat these Rare Hunters,\NKaiba and I will have to duel like a team!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.75,0:04:01.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba, you know there is\Nonly one way we can win.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.27,0:04:04.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't need you telling\Nme how to duel, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.99,0:04:08.49,Default,,0,0,0,,So you can forget the old\Nteamwork speech. Got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.09,0:04:09.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.00,0:04:12.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Who needs it? You do.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.65,0:04:15.99,Default,,0,0,0,,If you two are finished\Narguing, it's my turn!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.17,0:04:20.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I could attack your Magnet Warrior,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.43,0:04:24.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi, but since it reduces your\Nlife points by 500 every turn,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.49,0:04:26.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd be a fool to destroy it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.49,0:04:30.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Then there's your monster, Kaiba, but\Nyour face-down card could be a trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.09,0:04:33.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Not to worry, Umbra. Attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.75,0:04:36.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got us covered. Excellent.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.59,0:04:39.37,Default,,0,0,0,,First off, I'll set one card face-down.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.49,0:04:44.49,Default,,0,0,0,,And now, my Shining Abyss,\Nattack Kaiba's Force Raider!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.03,0:04:47.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on, fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.71,0:04:50.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You've activated my Ring of Destruction!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.75,0:04:55.47,Default,,0,0,0,,My destructive trap\Ncard will wipe out your.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.55,0:04:58.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Shining Abyss. Both of us\Nwill lose close to 2,000.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.93,0:05:01.91,Default,,0,0,0,,life points but only you\Nwill be out one monster
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.99,0:05:06.25,Default,,0,0,0,,sorry to disappoint\Nyou but my card cancels
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.33,0:05:10.85,Default,,0,0,0,,your trap what activate curse transfer my
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.93,0:05:13.45,Default,,0,0,0,,counter trap card is\Ntriggered whenever you play a
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.53,0:05:16.73,Default,,0,0,0,,trap card it automatically\Ntransfers your cards
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.81,0:05:19.81,Default,,0,0,0,,effect back to your\Nmonster say goodbye to your
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.59,0:05:22.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Umbra and Kaiba will both lose almost 2
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.99,0:05:25.53,Default,,0,0,0,,,000 life points when\NVorcerader is destroyed,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.61,0:05:28.32,Default,,0,0,0,,unless they have a magic\Ncard to protect them.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.43,0:05:30.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba, they may have something planned.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.77,0:05:31.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Zip it, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.91,0:05:35.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I know what's going on, and\NI don't need your advice.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.67,0:05:39.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Prepare to lose your monster and\Nalmost half your life points.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.23,0:05:44.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I've activated my magic\Ncard, Ring of Defense.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.51,0:05:47.28,Default,,0,0,0,,It will protect my life\Npoints from any damage.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.15,0:05:49.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm, nice try.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.25,0:05:51.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Why, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.41,0:05:55.11,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'm afraid your ring of defense\Nwon't be helping you, Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.19,0:05:56.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.01,0:05:58.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Because I activate this.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.15,0:06:01.25,Default,,0,0,0,,My spell transfer magic card.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.45,0:06:03.74,Default,,0,0,0,,It transfers your card's effects to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.87,0:06:08.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Which means my life points will remain\Nuntouched while yours are almost cut in half.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.87,0:06:11.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.97,0:06:15.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Too bad you won't be\Nseeing your brother again.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.97,0:06:20.09,Default,,0,0,0,,But where you're going, that will\Nbe the least of your worries, Kaiba!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.39,0:06:23.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Time to wipe out the\Nrest of your life points!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.11,0:06:24.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Shining Abyss!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.47,0:06:25.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Attack now!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.09,0:06:28.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Say hello to the Shadow Realm!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.27,0:06:38.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Now which way is the hospital again?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.73,0:06:47.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew I should have made a\Nleft at that hot dog cart. Ah,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.31,0:06:50.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever. Hiya, Doc. Well, I'm here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.13,0:06:54.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Who is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.87,0:06:58.29,Default,,0,0,0,,It's me, Tristan. Your\Nride home. Hey, Tristan.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.81,0:07:01.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, so I heard the great news Yeah,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.57,0:07:04.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I can take the bandages off\Nmy eyes tonight And I can
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.45,0:07:07.99,Default,,0,0,0,,take you to Battle City like I\Npromised I would But, Tristan
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.53,0:07:09.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, what's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.39,0:07:14.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm kind of nervous about the whole\Nthing, and I'm not sure if I can do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.47,0:07:15.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.73,0:07:19.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, what if I take the bandages\Noff and I'm still not able to see?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.39,0:07:22.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Serenity, of course you'll be able to see.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.57,0:07:24.37,Default,,0,0,0,,The doctor said you would.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.29,0:07:29.05,Default,,0,0,0,,And besides, all of us will\Nbe there to help you. True.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.49,0:07:31.35,Default,,0,0,0,,You're going to take those\Nthings off your eyes,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.43,0:07:34.13,Default,,0,0,0,,and the first thing you're\Ngoing to see is your brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.21,0:07:36.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Tristan. I needed that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.15,0:07:37.33,Default,,0,0,0,,No sweat.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.53,0:07:39.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, what do you say\Nwe hit the road, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.69,0:07:41.93,Default,,0,0,0,,And I promise you, before you know it,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.07,0:07:44.89,Default,,0,0,0,,you'll be watching Joey\Nduel with your own eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.27,0:07:46.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Bakura, are you asleep?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.21,0:07:51.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.12,0:07:52.58,Default,,0,0,0,,The doctor said you need rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.67,0:07:54.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You've been through a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.35,0:07:58.00,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a good thing Namu\Nfound you when he did.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.17,0:08:01.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I just wish we knew who did this to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.85,0:08:06.85,Default,,0,0,0,,You foolish old man.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.43,0:08:12.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, where are you taking me?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.81,0:08:13.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me go now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.25,0:08:15.53,Default,,0,0,0,,You talk too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.73,0:08:19.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you creeps really think\Nyou're gonna get away with this?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.01,0:08:20.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome home.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.97,0:08:24.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Get back here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.49,0:08:26.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me out of this dump right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.47,0:08:29.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I have friends in high places\Nand you're in big trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.73,0:08:30.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.97,0:08:35.44,Default,,0,0,0,,There's got to be a way out of this place!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.97,0:08:38.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder what those jerks did with Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.17,0:08:42.23,Default,,0,0,0,,And what do they want with us anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.31,0:08:44.60,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not like I have anything valuable.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.17,0:08:50.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Like the Millennium Puzzle, this\Nnecklace affords me certain powers.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.97,0:08:55.83,Default,,0,0,0,,With it, I have gazed 5,000 years into\Nthe past, to a time when evil sorcerers
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.45,0:08:58.55,Default,,0,0,0,,threatened to destroy the entire world.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.63,0:08:59.59,Default,,0,0,0,,However,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.01,0:09:04.83,Default,,0,0,0,,there was one king who possessed a magic\Npowerful enough to stop this evil threat.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.11,0:09:08.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this part of the threat\NIshizu warned us about?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.31,0:09:10.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe these are the guys\Nthat are after Yugi!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.47,0:09:13.13,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why they attacked us!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.29,0:09:14.83,Default,,0,0,0,,It all makes sense now!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.73,0:09:18.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone's trying to get\Nsomething from Yugi and
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.05,0:09:21.99,Default,,0,0,0,,they're doing it by putting\Nhis friends in danger!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.25,0:09:24.85,Default,,0,0,0,,You're finished, Kaiba!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.41,0:09:31.59,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.21,0:09:34.63,Default,,0,0,0,,You, you saved my life points.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.87,0:09:38.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Your attack has been blocked thanks\Nto my magic card. It's simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.61,0:09:41.53,Default,,0,0,0,,It multiplied by Karibo.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.81,0:09:44.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Now your monster's attack\Nwon't affect my teammate.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.73,0:09:48.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Your furballs won't be\Naround for too long.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.65,0:09:51.03,Default,,0,0,0,,And when they go, so\Nwill your life points.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.11,0:09:56.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I realize your magic cards saved my life\Npoints, but next time I'll do it myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.25,0:10:01.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba, if you ever expect to see Mokuba\Nagain, we need to help each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.21,0:10:03.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.12,0:10:04.40,Default,,0,0,0,,the minute one of us falls,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.49,0:10:08.31,Default,,0,0,0,,the other won't stand a chance against\Ntheir unified tag team assault.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.39,0:10:11.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you questioning my\Nskills as a duelist, Yugi?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.43,0:10:15.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm saying we must combine our forces\Nin order to defeat these rare hunters.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.41,0:10:21.29,Default,,0,0,0,,They duel as a team, building on one\Nanother's moves, and we have to do the same!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.99,0:10:25.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I saved you and if you don't\Nprotect me the same way,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.53,0:10:29.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I may not be around to save\Nyou again. Then good riddance.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.57,0:10:35.79,Default,,0,0,0,,If they continue to disagree, their\NEgyptian god cards will be ours in no time
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.35,0:10:40.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Loomis. We have to clear out Yugi's\Ndefensive wall before we can move.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.67,0:10:44.51,Default,,0,0,0,,in and destroy the rest of Kaiba's\Nlife points Can you handle it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.77,0:10:50.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, and they'll never know what\Nhit them Until it's too late
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.15,0:10:56.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm so close.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.71,0:10:59.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Almost got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.99,0:11:01.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Just a few more.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.91,0:11:02.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.17,0:11:11.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, man, that was not fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.67,0:11:16.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, it could have been worse, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.35,0:11:19.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me go!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.13,0:11:23.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you know who you're messing with?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.13,0:11:23.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's there?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.35,0:11:26.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Mokuba!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.53,0:11:27.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, Teya!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.39,0:11:29.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.03,0:11:31.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.21,0:11:34.53,Default,,0,0,0,,So, they're called rare hunters?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.95,0:11:38.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, and I was trying to find\Nyou guys when they grabbed me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.17,0:11:40.51,Default,,0,0,0,,The same thing happened to Joey and me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.69,0:11:43.07,Default,,0,0,0,,And I think I know why. So do I.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.21,0:11:45.55,Default,,0,0,0,,They're just using us as\Nbait to trap my brother and
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.63,0:11:48.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi and then take their\Nrarest cards away from them.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.41,0:11:49.55,Default,,0,0,0,,You know why, Téa?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.63,0:11:53.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Because Yugi and Kaiba both\Nhave an Egyptian god card.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.67,0:11:55.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Egyptian what? Gods.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.75,0:11:59.41,Default,,0,0,0,,They're the most powerful cards in\NDuel Monsters, and there's only three.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.49,0:12:02.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoever has them all\Nwill be unbeatable, Taya.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.71,0:12:04.65,Default,,0,0,0,,We just got caught in the middle.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.93,0:12:05.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.84,0:12:07.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you sure that's all these guys want?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.99,0:12:09.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, it's the only thing I can think of.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.69,0:12:10.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.97,0:12:12.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Um, no reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.69,0:12:13.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Really, it's nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.39,0:12:18.97,Default,,0,0,0,,If this has anything to do with ancient\Nevil forces trying to destroy the world,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.05,0:12:23.75,Default,,0,0,0,,then it's got to be about more than just\Ngetting a few good Duel Monsters cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.83,0:12:24.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I know it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.17,0:12:27.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Master Merrick will be pleased when we
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.21,0:12:29.98,Default,,0,0,0,,deliver both of your\NEgyptian God cards to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.07,0:12:33.25,Default,,0,0,0,,And tell him you've been\Nbanished to the Shadow Realm!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.73,0:12:34.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Enough of this!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.17,0:12:37.93,Default,,0,0,0,,My Blue-Eyes White Dragon!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.39,0:12:41.13,Default,,0,0,0,,This card can destroy\Ntheir monster with ease,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.27,0:12:44.51,Default,,0,0,0,,but I have to sacrifice two weaker\Nmonsters in order to summon it,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.59,0:12:45.77,Default,,0,0,0,,and I can't do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.85,0:12:49.69,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as these rare hunters\Nhave Mask of Restrict in play,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.93,0:12:51.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't sacrifice anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.23,0:12:53.75,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'll find a way.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.01,0:12:57.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll wipe them both out by\Nmyself and take back my brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.67,0:12:59.91,Default,,0,0,0,,They'll be sorry they ever met me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.37,0:13:03.66,Default,,0,0,0,,We can do this, Kai, but we\Njust have to duel as a team.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.67,0:13:06.95,Default,,0,0,0,,First, I'll place one card face down.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.21,0:13:12.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I'll summon Battle Ox in defense\Nmode to protect my life points.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.37,0:13:16.91,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't expect a win by\Nhiding behind weak monsters
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.99,0:13:21.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Our Shining Abyss has\N2,600 attack points. It can
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.71,0:13:25.31,Default,,0,0,0,,easily annihilate your battle\Nox And tear down your wall
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.39,0:13:29.57,Default,,0,0,0,,of fur balls leaving your life\Npoints wide open. Right, Loomis?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.43,0:13:31.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Precisely,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.34,0:13:33.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Umbra Looks like you'll\Nnever see your friends
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.87,0:13:38.19,Default,,0,0,0,,again Not where you'll\Nbe going But before I
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.27,0:13:41.03,Default,,0,0,0,,completely wipe out your\Nlife points I must first
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.11,0:13:44.05,Default,,0,0,0,,demolish your defensive\Nwall of miniature monsters
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.75,0:13:50.15,Default,,0,0,0,,And I have just the magic card\Nto do it. Another mask. Behold.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.81,0:13:53.97,Default,,0,0,0,,My mask of dispel
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.79,0:14:00.27,Default,,0,0,0,,It will cover your multiplying\Nmagic card and conceal
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.35,0:14:04.21,Default,,0,0,0,,its effect So I'm afraid your\NKaribo army will be reduced
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.29,0:14:07.93,Default,,0,0,0,,back down to one With your\Nweak defenses crumbling
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.01,0:14:11.67,Default,,0,0,0,,It's only a matter of time\Nbefore we destroy you both.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.05,0:14:16.27,Default,,0,0,0,,This was even easier than I thought,\Nand I'm not through with you yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.11,0:14:20.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Just like your Magnet Warrior's\NMask, with this in play,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.81,0:14:23.71,Default,,0,0,0,,you lose 500 more life points every turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.17,0:14:26.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.31,0:14:30.51,Default,,0,0,0,,With two of my cards covered by masks,\NI'll lose 1,000 life points every turn!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.59,0:14:33.49,Default,,0,0,0,,If we don't figure out how to\Nstop them soon, it's all over!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.57,0:14:38.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Next, I'll summon my Grand Tiki Elder\Nand rid the field of your Karimbo.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.31,0:14:47.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Attack now!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.33,0:14:57.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Now your life points are wide\Nopen for a direct attack, Yugi,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.31,0:15:01.43,Default,,0,0,0,,since your Magnet Warrior can't defend\Nyou thanks to the mask it's wearing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.51,0:15:04.07,Default,,0,0,0,,And as soon as your\Nlife points reach zero,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.29,0:15:06.91,Default,,0,0,0,,you'll plummet directly\Nto the Shadow Realm.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.75,0:15:12.21,Default,,0,0,0,,You two can't possibly win this duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.81,0:15:16.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Not only can't you sacrifice your\Nmonsters to summon stronger ones,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.25,0:15:20.37,Default,,0,0,0,,but thanks to our math cards, you lose\N1,000 life points every turn, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.45,0:15:21.28,Default,,0,0,0,,You're finished.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.36,0:15:22.19,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll see.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.63,0:15:24.05,Default,,0,0,0,,This doesn't look good.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.33,0:15:26.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I need a card to turn this around.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.51,0:15:27.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I draw.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.83,0:15:32.77,Default,,0,0,0,,This trap card allows me to destroy\None card in my opponent's hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.91,0:15:34.62,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not enough to help us.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.05,0:15:36.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe that card can help.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.83,0:15:39.12,Default,,0,0,0,,If I were to activate card destruction,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.33,0:15:41.11,Default,,0,0,0,,each duelist would have to throw out all
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.19,0:15:44.91,Default,,0,0,0,,their cards and redraw an\Nentirely new hand. But wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.23,0:15:48.97,Default,,0,0,0,,If Kaiba has a plan to beat them and I\Nforce him to get rid of his entire hand,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.05,0:15:50.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I could ruin his plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.89,0:15:52.09,Default,,0,0,0,,What choice do I have?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.17,0:15:56.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba doesn't want to duel as a team,\Nand I have no idea what his strategy is.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.47,0:16:01.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to make a move, but it could cost\Nus the duel, and we can't afford to lose!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.85,0:16:03.32,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you waiting for?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.75,0:16:07.99,Default,,0,0,0,,You couldn't possibly make things any\Nworse than you already have, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.53,0:16:12.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks to you, the cards we're\Nholding are absolutely useless.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.43,0:16:17.37,Default,,0,0,0,,In fact, I have a card in my hand\Nthat could win this game for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.57,0:16:21.28,Default,,0,0,0,,But due to your sloppy dueling,\NI can't summon it to the field.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.77,0:16:23.71,Default,,0,0,0,,It's better off in the graveyard.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.47,0:16:29.15,Default,,0,0,0,,It sounds like Kaiba\Nwants to discard his hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.23,0:16:31.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I think I know what I need to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.83,0:16:35.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, have you ever seen\Nsuch a pathetic team?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.83,0:16:39.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Defeating them and taking their\NEgyptian god cards will be simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.49,0:16:42.01,Default,,0,0,0,,They've already done\Nmost of the work for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.09,0:16:42.97,Default,,0,0,0,,That's enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.17,0:16:44.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I place one card face down.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.55,0:16:47.99,Default,,0,0,0,,And that will end my turn. I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.17,0:16:52.94,Default,,0,0,0,,It appears you weren't able to summon\Nanother monster to defend your life points.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.17,0:16:57.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Not that it would have mattered, for I'm\Nabout to summon an unstoppable creature.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.75,0:16:58.58,Default,,0,0,0,,But first,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.77,0:17:03.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I need to play my all-powerful magic\Ncard known as Curse of the Masked Beast.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.37,0:17:06.65,Default,,0,0,0,,What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.01,0:17:11.33,Default,,0,0,0,,This card allows me to sacrifice\Nboth our monsters and call
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.41,0:17:15.23,Default,,0,0,0,,forth one of the most destructive\Nforces you've ever experienced.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.51,0:17:19.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Behold the almighty power\Nof the Masked Beast.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.39,0:17:28.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing can stop his wrath, so\Nprepare to lose it all, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.53,0:17:29.39,Default,,0,0,0,,It can't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.61,0:17:32.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Time to say goodbye to\Nyour life points. No!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.23,0:17:36.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Send him to the Shadow\NRealm, my masked beast.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.17,0:17:40.55,Default,,0,0,0,,That'll have to bend.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.43,0:17:47.41,Default,,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.67,0:17:49.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba's monster intercepted my attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.25,0:17:51.23,Default,,0,0,0,,It can't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.31,0:17:52.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you surprised?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.11,0:17:56.89,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a double duel after all,\Nand my teammate was in danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.21,0:18:02.09,Default,,0,0,0,,So I used my Battle Ox to defend his\Nlife points against your masked beast.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.37,0:18:06.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought that they weren't working\Ntogether as a team, Loomis. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.03,0:18:08.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, Yugi, give it a rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.13,0:18:12.11,Default,,0,0,0,,There's one reason I\Nhelped you, so I could win.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.37,0:18:13.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Then you're a fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.11,0:18:18.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Saving your partner caused you to\Nlose your only defensive monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.63,0:18:20.95,Default,,0,0,0,,And soon it will cause you\Nto lose the rest of your
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.03,0:18:24.09,Default,,0,0,0,,life points when my masked\Nbeast moves in for the attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.17,0:18:26.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Unless Yugi returns my favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.39,0:18:27.79,Default,,0,0,0,,You fools can't win.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.01,0:18:29.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Reveal face down card.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.69,0:18:31.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Card destruction. Oh no.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.09,0:18:34.59,Default,,0,0,0,,We lose our entire hands. That's correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.21,0:18:41.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Now each duelist must deposit every card\Nin their hand into the card graveyard.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.55,0:18:46.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Once they're buried, you must start\Nover by drawing a completely new hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.59,0:18:49.89,Default,,0,0,0,,This might be my only\Nchance to save my friends!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.19,0:18:52.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I'll send my hand to the graveyard.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.09,0:18:56.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Did your partner force you to\Ngive up any cards you needed?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.81,0:19:00.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Actually, what just happened is\Nquite the opposite, Rare Hunter.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.77,0:19:05.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Without the ability to sacrifice, I wasn't\Nable to summon the monster in my hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.23,0:19:06.33,Default,,0,0,0,,But now I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.05,0:19:09.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch closely.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.63,0:19:12.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Reveal Monster Reborn!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.65,0:19:16.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I can bring back the powerful\Nmonster I just sent to the graveyard!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.59,0:19:18.43,Default,,0,0,0,,My Blue-Eyed White Dragon!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.87,0:19:20.41,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not possible!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.79,0:19:21.63,Default,,0,0,0,,It is.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.27,0:19:26.93,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the price you pay for using\Nmy little brother to get to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.31,0:19:31.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Now maybe you'll think twice before\Ndisrespecting the Kaiba family.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.03,0:19:34.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Now go, my Blue-Eyed!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.55,0:19:48.93,Default,,0,0,0,,You're mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.01,0:19:54.69,Default,,0,0,0,,You're mine. You're mine.
